WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:19.369
The Witch watched the mermaid closely.

2
00:00:19.389 --> 00:00:28.073
"I will prepare a magic brew for you," she said, "that will change your tail into legs and

3
00:00:28.173 --> 00:00:31.035
feet." "How wonderful!"

4
00:00:31.475 --> 00:00:32.636
cried the Little Mermaid.

5
00:00:33.868 --> 00:00:37.371
"With legs I can walk on land and be near my Prince.

6
00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:41.053
Then surely he will fall in love with me!"

7
00:00:41.073 --> 00:00:46.237
"I must warn you," continued the Sea Witch.

8
00:00:46.257 --> 00:00:50.400
"You will feel a lot of pain whenever you stand.

9
00:00:51.681 --> 00:00:55.703
To others your walk will look graceful, like a dancer's.

10
00:00:57.064 --> 00:01:01.988
But every step will sting like a sharp blade cutting into your feet."

11
00:01:04.736 --> 00:01:07.538
The Sea Witch paused to pet one of her frogs.

12
00:01:08.738 --> 00:01:13.641
Then she asked her, "Are you willing to suffer for what you desire?"

13
00:01:13.661 --> 00:01:16.083
"Yes, of course!"

14
00:01:16.663 --> 00:01:18.724
replied the Little Mermaid excitedly.

15
00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:23.227
"I would do anything to live in the Upper World and get a soul."

16
00:01:23.247 --> 00:01:32.092
"Remember," said the witch, "once you become human, you can never be a mermaid again.

17
00:01:33.504 --> 00:01:38.665
You will no longer live in your father's palace or play with your sisters.

18
00:01:39.906 --> 00:01:43.207
You can no longer ask your grandmother for advice.

19
00:01:44.507 --> 00:01:47.588
You can never come back to the Sea Kingdom again."

20
00:01:47.608 --> 00:01:52.229
"I understand," said the Little Mermaid softly.

21
00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:57.871
The Sea Witch bent down and looked right into the mermaid's eyes.

22
00:01:57.891 --> 00:02:02.432
"One more thing, my dear," she added.

23
00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:08.342
"If the Prince doesn't marry you, you will not get your soul.

24
00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:15.765
And the morning after he marries another, you will die and become sea foam."

25
00:02:15.785 --> 00:02:20.687
"I will take that risk," said the mermaid, turning pale.

26
00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:24.928
"I just know I can make the Prince fall in love with me."

27
00:02:24.948 --> 00:02:33.272
"Well, my dear, to seal our deal, you must give me something of value," said the witch.

28
00:02:34.736 --> 00:02:37.978
"You have the sweetest voice of all the mermaids.

29
00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.081
Everyone says it is very special.

30
00:02:43.542 --> 00:02:47.405
I will give you the brew if you give me your voice."

31
00:02:49.046 --> 00:02:52.789
"But I'll need my voice to tell the Prince―," said the mermaid.

32
00:02:52.809 --> 00:02:56.832
"So, have you lost your courage now?"

33
00:02:57.452 --> 00:02:59.033
asked the Sea Witch, laughing.

34
00:02:59.053 --> 00:03:02.376
"No," the Little Mermaid answered.

35
00:03:03.664 --> 00:03:06.426
She thought of the times she sang for her family.

36
00:03:08.147 --> 00:03:12.730
Remembering those happy moments, the Little Mermaid felt very sad.

37
00:03:14.071 --> 00:03:18.454
Slowly she whispered, "I will give you my voice."

38
00:03:18.474 --> 00:03:21.276
"Then follow me."

39
00:03:22.537 --> 00:03:25.659
The Sea Witch took the Little Mermaid into her hut.

40
00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:33.004
Once inside, the witch placed a large pot over a steaming hole in the floor.

41
00:03:34.384 --> 00:03:36.786
She chopped up some snakes and jellyfish.

42
00:03:37.967 --> 00:03:41.990
She threw the pieces into the pot with some other slimy things.

43
00:03:43.191 --> 00:03:51.839
Then the Sea Witch chanted: The Little Mermaid asks to love A prince who only lives above.

44
00:03:52.980 --> 00:03:57.904
Now that her heart has made its choice, She'll have her legs.

45
00:03:57.924 --> 00:03:59.765
I'll have her voice!

46
00:04:01.366 --> 00:04:02.888
The liquid began to bubble.

47
00:04:04.252 --> 00:04:07.575
Smoky, ghostly faces rose from the pot.

48
00:04:08.796 --> 00:04:13.439
The magic brew was ready, and the witch poured it into a small bottle.

49
00:04:13.459 --> 00:04:18.203
"Here is what you came for," said the Sea Witch.

50
00:04:19.564 --> 00:04:21.766
She handed the bottle to the Little Mermaid.

51
00:04:22.826 --> 00:04:26.529
The mermaid tried to say something, but no sound came out.

52
00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.712
Her beautiful voice was gone.

53
00:04:31.608 --> 00:04:35.712
"Before sunrise, swim to shore," the Sea Witch commanded.

54
00:04:35.732 --> 00:04:40.595
"When you are on dry land, drink the brew I gave you.

55
00:04:41.837 --> 00:04:45.900
Your tail will split in half and become a pair of legs and feet.

56
00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:47.381
Now go."

57
00:04:48.562 --> 00:04:50.784
The Little Mermaid nodded silently.
